+
+- `evidence/16b_semantics_int_list_bool_exact.txt`
+- `evidence/17_fresh_k_operational_smokes.txt`
+- `evidence/17b_k_operational_results_concise.txt`
+- `evidence/18b_lean_operational_bridge_tests_pass.txt`
